\end_inset

.
 Building random trees to a certain depth can either be done in  full or
 grow mode, with the full method filling up all levels with operators and
 the grow method inserting terminal nodes by chance (50%), resulting in
 a much smaller branching factor and less complex formulas.
 In order to obtain as diverse a mix of new candidates as possible, both
 approaches are usually combined (half ramped mode).
 
