status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout

$
\backslash
{
\backslash
text{delete},
\backslash
text{insert},
\backslash
text{modify}
\backslash
}$
\end_layout

\end_inset

 needed to transform T into T'
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "tedOldestPaper"

\end_inset

.
 It is a well-known problem in theoretical computer science, whose computation
 was largely worked on and lead to both robust and efficient algorithms.
