\begin_layout Paragraph
Olymp-reproduction (Pareto reproduction)
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Similar to the Greek gods who came to earth to reproduce, the pareto candidates
 were also given the opportunity to intermingle with the current population.
 By chance, solutions already found and their genes could be completely
 lost.
 In order not to lose already found solutions permanently, the genes of
 the best candidates are to provide a very small current for backups of
 the best-ofs of the past.
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset

The olymp reproduction includes in particular the possibility for the origin
 tree to reproduce itself.
\end_layout

